ls and members of the British aristocracy.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"When asked about the whirlwind romance, Thomas Archibald Roberts, who holds the title of Baron of Wem, expressed his joy and gratitude.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"\\\"I never thought I'd find someone who shares my passion for public service and commitment to making a difference.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"Johannes is an incredible partner, and I feel fortunate to have him by my side.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"Johannes Schwarzenberg, a prominent figure in Austrian politics, echoed Roberts' sentiments.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"\\\"Thomas is an extraordinary individual with a heart of gold.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"Our shared values and dedication to creating positive change brought us together, and I'm thrilled to start this new chapter in our lives.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"The couple met at a charity gala in London last year, where they bonded over their shared interest in environmental conservation.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"Since then, they have been inseparable, with Schwarzenberg frequently visiting Roberts at his estate in Shropshire.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"Data from the UK's Office for National Statistics reveals that same-sex marriages between individuals from different countries have increased by 25% in the past five years, with Austria and the UK ranking among the top five countries for international same-sex unions.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"Lord Roberts, a vocal advocate for LGBTQ+ rights, has been a driving force behind several charitable initiatives, including the establishment of a community center for LGBTQ+ youth in rural Shropshire.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"Schwarzenberg, a member of the Austrian National Council, has been a strong proponent of progressive policies, including marriage equality and climate action.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"As the newlyweds settle into their new life together, they plan to continue their individual pursuits while supporting each other's endeavors.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"\\\"We're excited to explore new opportunities and make a positive impact together,\\\" Roberts said, beaming with pride.\"}]}"
